## Registration Checklist — OpenCart Demo

### Preconditions
- [ ] User is not logged in
- [ ] Application is accessible
- [ ] User is on the Registration page

---

### Registration Page UI
- [ ] Registration page opens successfully
- [ ] Page title is displayed correctly
- [ ] All required fields are visible:
  - First Name
  - Last Name
  - Email
  - Password
  - Password Confirm
- [ ] Continue button is displayed

---

### Mandatory Fields Validation
- [ ] Registration without filling any fields
- [ ] Registration with only mandatory fields filled
- [ ] Validation message shown for empty required fields
- [ ] User cannot proceed without accepting Privacy Policy

---

### Email Field Validation
- [ ] Valid email format is accepted
- [ ] Invalid email format is rejected
- [ ] Registration with already existing email
- [ ] Error message is shown for duplicate email

---

### Password Validation
- [ ] Password field masks input
- [ ] Password and Confirm Password must match
- [ ] Registration fails if passwords do not match
- [ ] Error message is displayed for mismatch

---

### Successful Registration
- [ ] Registration with valid data
- [ ] Success message is displayed
- [ ] User is redirected after successful registration
- [ ] User is logged in after registration (if applicable)

---

### Negative Scenarios (basic)
- [ ] Submit form with invalid data
- [ ] Proper error messages are displayed
- [ ] Enter data is not cleared after validation error
